  "content": "<section class=\"gl-hero\" aria-labelledby=\"gl-hero-heading\"><div class=\"gl-hero-video\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><iframe title=\"GioLina wedding film background\" src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/548643452?background=1&amp;autoplay=1&amp;muted=1&amp;loop=1#t=5s\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" tabindex=\"-1\"></iframe></div><div class=\"gl-hero-copy\"><p class=\"gl-eyebrow\">Wedding cinematography &amp; photography</p><h1 id=\"gl-hero-heading\"><span>Wedding films</span><span>with a personal perspective</span></h1><p class=\"gl-hero-sub\">Beautifully captured. Deeply felt.</p><a class=\"gl-button gl-button-light\" href=\"/contact-us-2/\">Inquire</a></div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-section gl-intro\"><div class=\"gl-intro-copy\"><p class=\"gl-eyebrow\">A personal approach</p><h2>Your wedding.<br>Seen with care.</h2><p>Thoughtful films and photographs, made with attention to the people who make your day yours.</p><p>From our first conversation to the final edit, we take the time to get to know you.</p><a class=\"gl-text-link\" href=\"/portfolio-2/\">Explore the film portfolio</a></div><div class=\"gl-pair\"><figure><img src=\"/assets/d5c736b9d423634c.png\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1800\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"A couple sharing a quiet kiss in silhouette\"></figure><figure><img src=\"/assets/9d28de469d3f3c6b.jpg\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Black and white wedding portrait of a bride and groom\"></figure></div></section>\n<figure class=\"gl-ballroom\"><img src=\"/assets/cb99e1db42a51c75.jpg\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"A bride and groom sharing a dip and kiss beneath a domed ballroom ceiling\"><figcaption>A day to remember</figcaption></figure>\n<section class=\"gl-feature\"><div class=\"gl-feature-inner\"><figure class=\"gl-film-poster\"><img src=\"/assets/690ef6c3e99444cd.png\" width=\"617\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Bianca and Bobby on their wedding day\"><button type=\"button\" data-vimeo-id=\"328842441\" data-film-title=\"Bianca &amp; Bobby\"><span>Play film</span></button></figure><div><p class=\"gl-eyebrow\">New York City, New York</p><h2>Bianca &amp; Bobby</h2><a class=\"gl-text-link\" href=\"/portfolio-2/\">Explore our cinematography</a></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-home-stories\" aria-labelledby=\"gl-stories-title\"><h2 id=\"gl-stories-title\">Films &amp; photographs</h2><div class=\"gl-story-grid\"><article><div class=\"gl-film-preview\"><iframe src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/548643452?muted=1&amp;title=0&amp;byline=0&amp;portrait=0&amp;dnt=1\" title=\"GioLina wedding film\" loading=\"lazy\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></iframe><button type=\"button\" data-vimeo-id=\"548643452\" data-film-title=\"GioLina wedding film\"><span>Play film</span></button></div><h3>Cinematography</h3><p>Hear the vows, the laughter, and the celebration again.</p><a class=\"gl-text-link\" href=\"/portfolio-2/\">Explore the film portfolio</a></article><article><figure><img src=\"/assets/7353475231731939.jpg\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"A wedding couple together beside the waterfront\"></figure><h3>Photography</h3><p>Natural portraits and candid photographs, with room to be yourselves.</p><a class=\"gl-text-link\" href=\"/portfolio/\">Explore the photography portfolio</a></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-section gl-review\"><div class=\"gl-film-preview gl-alexandria-film\"><iframe src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/1008616852?muted=1&amp;title=0&amp;byline=0&amp;portrait=0&amp;dnt=1\" title=\"Alexandria’s wedding film\" loading=\"lazy\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></iframe><button type=\"button\" data-vimeo-id=\"1008616852\" data-film-title=\"Alexandria’s wedding film\" aria-label=\"Play Alexandria’s wedding film\"><span>Play Alexandria’s film</span></button></div><div><h2>From our clients</h2><blockquote><p>“It was absolutely breathtaking and immediately took us right back to our wedding day. He captured the entire day and every emotion that came with it perfectly.”</p><cite>Alexandria P</cite></blockquote><a class=\"gl-text-link\" href=\"/client-reviews/\">More reviews</a></div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-section gl-experience\"><div><p class=\"gl-eyebrow\">The GioLina Films experience</p><h2>Enjoy your day.<br>We’ll take care of the cameras.</h2><p>Our relaxed approach puts you at ease, so you can be yourself and enjoy your wedding day in front of our cameras.</p><a class=\"gl-text-link\" href=\"/experience-2/\">Discover the experience</a></div><figure><img src=\"/assets/e941428ca2af1172.jpeg\" width=\"1707\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"A bride looking toward her partner during their ceremony\"></figure></section>\n<section class=\"gl-about\"><div class=\"gl-about-inner\"><div class=\"gl-recognition\" aria-label=\"Wedding platforms\"><img src=\"/assets/228946ec584cbe8d.jpg\" width=\"1024\" height=\"535\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"The Knot\"><img src=\"/assets/41b1a2dbc44d0e67.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"256\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"WeddingWire\"></div><div><p class=\"gl-eyebrow\">Behind the lens</p><h2>We are GioLina Films.</h2><p>GioLina is personal to Frank — from the experience behind the camera to the name inspired by his children.</p><a class=\"gl-text-link\" href=\"/about-us-2/\">Get to know us</a></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-closing\"><figure><img src=\"/assets/2487c01449acd020.jpg\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"A newly married couple kissing on a city street\"></figure><div><h2>Let's create<br>something beautiful.</h2><a class=\"gl-button\" href=\"/contact-us-2/\">Inquire</a></div></section>",
  "header": "<header><div class=\"gl-nav\"><nav class=\"gl-nav-inner gl-desktop-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"/\" aria-current=\"page\">Home</a><a href=\"/portfolio-2/\">Cinematography</a><a href=\"/portfolio/\">Photography</a><a href=\"/client-reviews/\">Reviews</a><a href=\"/experience-2/\">Experience</a><a href=\"/about-us/\">About Us</a><a href=\"/contact-us-2/\">Contact Us</a></nav><details class=\"gl-mobile-menu\"><summary>Menu</summary><nav aria-label=\"Mobile navigation\"><a href=\"/\" aria-current=\"page\">Home</a><a href=\"/portfolio-2/\">Cinematography</a><a href=\"/portfolio/\">Photography</a><a href=\"/client-reviews/\">Reviews</a><a href=\"/experience-2/\">Experience</a><a href=\"/about-us/\">About Us</a><a href=\"/contact-us-2/\">Contact Us</a></nav></details></div><div class=\"gl-masthead\"><img src=\"/assets/e845a4337da29ba0.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"411\" alt=\"GioLina — photography and cinematography\" fetchpriority=\"high\"><p>Cinematic wedding filmmaking &amp; photography</p><div class=\"gl-header-actions\"><nav class=\"gl-social-icons\" aria-label=\"Social media\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/GioLinaFilms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Instagram\"><span class=\"gl-social-glyph\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xf16d;</span></a><a href=\"https://vimeo.com/readytogoproductions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Vimeo\"><span class=\"gl-social-glyph\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xf40a;</span></a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/GioLinaFilms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Facebook\"><span class=\"gl-social-glyph\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xf39e;</span></a></nav><a class=\"gl-header-inquire\" href=\"/contact-us-2/\">Inquire about your day</a></div></div></header>",
  "footer": "<footer class=\"gl-footer\"><div class=\"gl-footer-inner\"><div><img class=\"gl-footer-logo\" src=\"/assets/e845a4337da29ba0.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"411\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"GioLina Films\"></div><nav aria-label=\"Footer navigation\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><a href=\"/portfolio-2/\">Cinematography</a><a href=\"/portfolio/\">Photography</a><a href=\"/client-reviews/\">Reviews</a><a href=\"/experience-2/\">Experience</a><a href=\"/about-us/\">About Us</a><a href=\"/contact-us-2/\">Contact Us</a></nav><div><p><a href=\"mailto:info@giolina.co\">info@giolina.co</a></p><p><a href=\"tel:8663060308\">866-306-0308</a></p><nav class=\"gl-social-icons\" aria-label=\"Footer social media\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/GioLinaFilms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Instagram\"><span class=\"gl-social-glyph\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xf16d;</span></a><a href=\"https://vimeo.com/readytogoproductions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Vimeo\"><span class=\"gl-social-glyph\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xf40a;</span></a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/GioLinaFilms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Facebook\"><span class=\"gl-social-glyph\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xf39e;</span></a></nav></div></div><div class=\"gl-footer-bottom\">GioLina Films · Wedding cinematography &amp; photography</div></footer>",
